# ── Review Checklist Per Domain ───────────────────────────────────────

# @architecture-owner:
#  - New public model/contract has test anchor
#  - Adapter payload has schemaVersion and compatibility note
#  - view_ide does not import Flutter presentation
#  - Competitor names do not enter UI
#  - Architecture docs stay aligned with code structure

# @agent-owner:
#  - New agent tool has permission test, redaction test, journal test
#  - No raw API key storage
#  - Context snapshots are redacted before display
#  - Tool calls are journaled with permission level

# @module-owner:
#  - New module contribution has manifest schema test
#  - Extension isolation level is appropriate
#  - Staged update lifecycle is tested

# @adapter-owner:
#  - New adapter payload has schemaVersion
#  - Unknown field tolerance is verified
#  - Blocked reasons use standard codes
#  - Stale revision detection is tested
